{"1692240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fortune's Run", "steam_appid": 1692240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2635000], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE PARTNERSHIP AGREEMENT FOR THIS GAME HAS BEEN STOLEN BY MY DOMESTIC ABUSER AND VALVE IS REFUSING TO TRANSFER THE RIGHTS BACK TO ME, THE SOLE DEVELOPER. NO ONE MAKES PROFITS FROM SALES ANYMORE, VALVE KEEPS EVERYTHING. BUY AT OWN PERIL. THERE WILL BE NO MORE UPDATES.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the quiet dystopia of Fortune's Run, where food is free yet people starve and every living soul on New Zabra is bought and paid for by off-world interests. A classic FPS with undertones of role-playing in the spirit of Deus Ex and EYE: Divine Cybermancy, featuring the campy tone of space operas and titles like Metal Gear Solid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/9a10face2161fab13fdf7bf6b8b36a5b.poster.avif?t=1787765329\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/9a10face2161fab13fdf7bf6b8b36a5b.webm?t=1787765329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/9a10face2161fab13fdf7bf6b8b36a5b.mp4?t=1787765329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an innovative combat system inspired by fighting games and character action titles. Memorize combos and specials that break stance, use grabs and mix-ups to throw off your enemies' guard. The depth will keep you practicing for months.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/4dfd04f9ea189b372a0c01bb8067bf0b.poster.avif?t=1787765329\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/4dfd04f9ea189b372a0c01bb8067bf0b.webm?t=1787765329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/4dfd04f9ea189b372a0c01bb8067bf0b.mp4?t=1787765329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in a post-industrial world of barren factories and boarded up store-fronts. Explore immersive environments, meet eclectic low-lives and witness Mozah's tragic tale in full voice-acted glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/c3d8d1df303a017bc63235517d955fd3.poster.avif?t=1787765329\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/c3d8d1df303a017bc63235517d955fd3.webm?t=1787765329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/c3d8d1df303a017bc63235517d955fd3.mp4?t=1787765329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to defend yourself with invincibility frames, parries, counters and true Quake-engine strafe-jumping movement. Damage is lethal, combat is tactical and practice is imperative. A return to the form of old classics on maximum difficulty. Blink and you're dead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/ded395629b39b149f710c55d24db883a.poster.avif?t=1787765329\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/ded395629b39b149f710c55d24db883a.webm?t=1787765329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/ded395629b39b149f710c55d24db883a.mp4?t=1787765329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to distant stars and lay eyes on set-pieces inspired by the science-fiction greats. A fully simulated centrifugal space station, a train that rides up a cable to the heavens. No two levels the same, always with something to impress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/6b93dd60d04b2bfe276d0fe257e39e16.poster.avif?t=1787765329\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/6b93dd60d04b2bfe276d0fe257e39e16.webm?t=1787765329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/6b93dd60d04b2bfe276d0fe257e39e16.mp4?t=1787765329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the pain. The only way to survive is to learn, and the only way to learn is to fail. With a deeply customizable difficulty system and endless mechanics to master, Fortune's Run will leave you only two options: persistence or death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692240/extras/9ac5434568481261aa4927589f09ecc4.avif?t=1787765329\" width=300 height=312 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE PARTNERSHI